---
/**
 * Prerendered, like almost everything an anonymous adopter browses. No `prerender` export
 * here because static is the default — the exception is the file that opts out.
 *
 * This page is served from Static Assets without invoking Worker code. What holds that
 * true is `web/test/routing.test.ts` — "exists as a static asset, which is what lets the
 * asset router answer it" — which asks the `ASSETS` binding for `/` directly. Adding
 * `prerender = false` here makes that binding return 404 and the test fail.
 */
---

